{
  "_comment": [
    "gh-1630 I2 — the vendor supply chain lock: every artifact the",
    "extension package carries is pinned to a URL + post-transform",
    "SHA-256. scripts/fetch_vendor_assets.sh fetches ONLY from this",
    "lock, applies the declared `replacements` (each must occur exactly",
    "once — that is how remote constants are stripped out of vendored",
    "bundles, e.g. pyodide's CDN default indexURL), verifies the",
    "checksum and fails the build loud on any mismatch. Binaries are",
    "build-time fetched, never committed (browser_ext/vendor/ is",
    "gitignored); the PACKAGE carries them, the repo carries the lock."
  ],
